comment0.text=\r\n Serves "/thumbnail?path\=..." - a small scaled-down PNG for image files.\r\n Thumbnails are cached in memory, keyed by path + last-modified time, so\r\n scrolling a folder repeatedly doesn't re-decode images every time.\r\n
